a CloudKit re-hydrate action)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In-memory state may hold unflushed writes or live UI bindings; wholesale"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replacement silently drops them and surfaces as lost keystrokes. Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for that path — it records no changes and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lets you decide per-ID which side wins. Under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPersistentCloudKitContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the gotcha is especially sharp: "},{"code":".NSPersistentStoreRemoteChange","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" fires for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"local saves too, so a naïve “refresh on remote change” observer feeds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app its own writes."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Entities sharing an ID are collapsed to the first occurrence. A store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot represent duplicates — "},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" holds one index per ID — and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"admitting them corrupts the index: the map would keep only the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index while the array kept every copy, so "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" over-reports and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later delete orphans the earlier copy with no "},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entry at all,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leaving a row that is visible in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" but invisible to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and the subscript. Persisted rows can legitimately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"share an ID (CloudKit forbids unique constraints), so this initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has to be total rather than trusting its input."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)"]}],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/init(_:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)","role":"symbol","title":"init(_:)"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates."}],"role":"collection","title":"Swidux","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/values":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"values"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/values","abstract":[{"text":"All entities in insertion or